<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Application Form</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            margin: 20px;
            font-size: 12pt;
        }
        .container {
            width: 8.5in; /* Standard letter width */
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 1px solid black;
            padding: 10px;
        }
        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14pt;
            text-decoration: underline;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        td, th {
            border: 1px solid black;
            padding: 5px;
            vertical-align: top;
        }
        .no-border td, .no-border th {
            border: none;
        }
        .underline-input {
            border: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid black;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 2px 0;
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            font-size: 12pt;
            outline: none;
        }
        .underline-text {
            display: inline-block;
            border-bottom: 1px solid black;
            min-width: 100px; /* Adjust as needed */
            padding: 0 2px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .photo-box {
            border: 1px solid black;
            width: 138px;
            height: 120px;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 5px;
            font-size: 10pt;
            float: right;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }
        .bold {
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .text-center {
            text-align: center;
        }
        .small-text {
            font-size: 10pt;
        }
         .terms {
        text-align: center;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }

      .kannada-text {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      }

      .document {
        background: white;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .terms-list {
        margin: 0;
        padding-left: 116px;
        list-style: none;
        counter-reset: term-counter;
        padding-right: 74px;
      }

      .terms-list li {
        counter-increment: term-counter;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        position: relative;
        padding-left: 25px;
        text-align: justify;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .terms-list li::before {
        content: counter(term-counter) ".";
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .highlight {
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .declaration-section {
        padding-left: 114px;
        margin-top: 40px;
        text-align: center;
            padding-right: 72px;
      }

      .declaration-title {
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
      }

      .declaration-text {
        text-align: justify;
        font-size: 14px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }

      .signature-section {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: flex-end;
        margin-top: -33px;
        margin-bottom: -58px;
      }

      .signature-left {
        text-align: left;
      }

      .signature-right {
        text-align: right;
      }

      .signature-line {
        border-bottom: 1px solid black;
        width: 200px;
        height: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 1px;
        margin-right: 4px;
      }

      .office-section {
        margin-top: 40px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .office-title {
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }

      .office-fields {
        text-align: left;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
      }

      .office-field {
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        font-size: 14px;
        padding-left: 112px;
      }

      .field-line {
        display: inline-block;
        border-bottom: 1px solid black;
        width: 200px;
        height: 20px;
        margin-left: 10px;
        margin-right: 20px;
      }

      .office-signatures {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin-top: 30px;
        margin-left: 108px;
        padding-right: 90px;
      }

      .board-section {
        margin-top: 40px;
        text-align: center;
        padding-left: 105px;
        padding-right: 62px;

      }

      .board-title {
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }

      .board-text {
        text-align: justify;
        font-size: 14px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .board-signatures {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin-top: 40px;
      }

      .signature-block {
        text-align: center;
      }

      .signature-block .signature-line {
        width: 150px;
        margin: 0 auto 5px auto;
      }

      .page-number {
        text-align: left;
        font-size: 12px;
        margin-top: 40px;
      }

      .responsive-section {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .details-column {
        flex: 1 1 60%;
        min-width: 250px;
      }

      .photo-column {
        flex: 1 1 30%;
        min-width: 170px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .form-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .form-label {
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-right: 10px;
      }

      .form-input {
        margin-right: 10px;
      }

      .site-image img {
        max-width: 100%;
        height: auto;
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .responsive-section {
          flex-direction: column;
        }
        .photo-column {
          justify-content: center;
          margin-top: 10px;
        }
      }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
       <div>
   <!-- <img style="width: 747px; height: 200px;" src="/images/bANNER_DHS1.jpg" alt="logo"> -->
        <img style="width: 747px; height: 200px;" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/den0iz8zn/image/upload/v1752129621/bANNER_DHS1_krj3y3.jpg" alt="logo">
  </div>
        <div class="container">
        <h1>APPLICATION FOR MEMBERSHIP AND PURCHASE OF SITE</h1>

        <div style="overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          
             <table class="no-border" style="width: calc(100% - 170px);">
               
               
              
           
                <tr>
                    <td style="width: 150px;">Sl. No.</td>
                    <td><input type="text" class="underline-input" ></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td style="width: 250px;">NAME (Full name in Block Letters):</td>
                      <td><div type="text" class="underline-input" > <%= refname %></div></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>RANK / DESIGNATION:</td>
                    <td><div type="text" class="underline-input" style="width: 45%; display: inline-block;" ><%= rankDesignation %></div> SERVICE / ID NO. <div type="text" class="underline-input" style="width: 45%; display: inline-block;" ><%= serviceId %></div></td>
                </tr>
                           <div class="photo-box">
                <!-- Affix your<br>PP/SS<br>Photograph<br>along with<br>Signature<br>(5 Copies) -->
                 <img 
            src="<%= MemberPhoto %>"
            alt="virat kohli"
          />
            </div>
                <tr>
                    <td>RELATIONSHIP WITH THE APPLICANT:</td>
                    <td><div type="text" class="underline-input" ><%= relationship %></div></td>
                </tr>
                  
            </table>
        </div>

        <p style="margin-top: 0;">
            Booked a site of measuring <div type="text" class="underline-input" style="width: 150px; display: inline-block;" ><%= propertyDetails.length %> X <%= propertyDetails.breadth %></div> in the Project “<div type="text" class="underline-input" style="width: 150px; display: inline-block;" placeholder="Project Name"><%= propertyDetails.projectName %></div>” located at
            “<div type="text" class="underline-input" style="width: 300px; display: inline-block;" ><%= propertyDetails.projectName %> </div>” in <span class="bold">“DEFENCE HABITAT HOUSING CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETY LTD.”</span>
        </p>

        <table>
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 30%;">Applicant Name:</td>
                <td colspan="3"><div type="text" class="underline-input" ><%= name %></div></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Date of Birth:</td>
                <td style="width: 35%;"><div type="text" class="underline-input" ><%= dateofbirth.toDateString() %> </div></td>
                <td style="width: 10%;">Age:</td>
                <td style="width: 25%;"><div type="text" class="underline-input" > <%= nomineeAge %></div></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Father’s / Spouse Name:</td>
                <td colspan="3"><div type="text" class="underline-input" ><%= fatherName %></div></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><span class="bold">Correspondence Address</span></td>
                <td><span class="bold">Permanent Address</span></td>
                <td colspan="2"><span class="bold">Working Address</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><textarea class="underline-input" rows="5" ><%= contactAddress %></textarea></td>
                <td><textarea class="underline-input" rows="5" ><%= permanentAddress %></textarea></td>
                <td colspan="2"><textarea class="underline-input" rows="5" ><%= workingAddress %></textarea></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td rowspan="3">Nominee particulars</td>
                <td colspan="3">Name : <div type="text" class="underline-input" style="width: calc(100% - 60px); display: inline-block;" ><%= nomineeName %></div> </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td colspan="3">Age : <div type="text" class="underline-input" style="width: calc(100% - 60px); display: inline-block;" ><%= nomineeAge %> </div> Relationship : <div type="text" class="underline-input" style="width: calc(100% - 120px); display: inline-block;" ><%= nomineeRelation %></div> </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td colspan="3">Address : <div type="text" class="underline-input" style="width: calc(100% - 70px); display: inline-block;" ><%= nomineeAddress %></div> </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Remarks, if any</td>
                <td colspan="3"><p type="text" class="underline-input" > </p> </td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <table class="no-border">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 20%;">Phone No. (R)<div type="text" class="underline-input" style="width: calc(100% - 100px); display: inline-block;" > </div> </td>
                <td style="width: 20%;">Mobile:<div type="text" class="underline-input" style="width: calc(100% - 60px); display: inline-block;">  <%= mobileNumber %></div> </td>
                <td style="width: 20%;">E-mail:<div type="text" class="underline-input" style="width: calc(100% - 60px); display: inline-block;"> <%= email %></div></td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <tr>
                <td rowspan="3" class="bold text-center" style="width: 20%;">Membership<br>Payment Details</td>
                <td class="bold text-center" style="width: 15%;">Membership Amount</td>
                <td colspan="4" class="bold">Rs. 2500/- (Rupees Two Thousand Five Hundred Only)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="text-center">Cheque</td>
                <td class="text-center">DD</td>
                <td class="text-center">Online</td>
                <td colspan="2"></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="text-center"></td>
                <td class="text-center"></td>
                <td class="text-center"></td>
                <td style="width: 25%;">Bank <div type="text"  style="width: calc(100% - 40px); display: inline-block;" ><%= bankName %></div></td>
                <td style="width: 25%;">Branch <div type="text"  style="width: calc(100% - 50px); display: inline-block;" ><%= branchName %></div> </td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <tr>
                <td rowspan="3" class="bold text-center" style="width: 20%;">Purchase of Site<br>Payment Details</td>
                <td class="bold text-center" style="width: 15%;">Site Advance Amount</td>
                <td class="bold" style="width: 10%;">Rs. <div type="text"  style="width: calc(100% - 30px); display: inline-block;" > <%= amount %></div></td>
                <td colspan="3" class="bold">In words <div type="text"  style="width: calc(100% - 70px); display: inline-block;" > </div> </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="text-center">Cheque</td>
                <td class="text-center">DD</td>
                <td class="text-center">Online</td>
                <td colspan="2"></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
               
                <td style="width: 25%;">Bank <div type="text"  style="width: calc(100% - 40px); display: inline-block;" ><%= bankName %> </div></td>
                <td style="width: 25%;">Branch <div type="text"  style="width: calc(100% - 50px); display: inline-block;" ><%= branchName %> </div> </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
        <table>
        <tr>
          <td colspan="4" style="text-align: center">
            <strong>Account Details For NEFT/RTGS/Online Transaction:</strong>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td width="25%"><strong>Account Name</strong></td>
          <td colspan="3">
            : DEFENCE HABITAT HOUSING COOPERATIVE SOCIETY LIMITED.
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Account Number</strong></td>
          <td colspan="3">: 05138870000120</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Bank</strong></td>
          <td colspan="3">: YES BANK LTD.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Branch</strong></td>
          <td colspan="3">: SAHAKAR NAGAR</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>IFSC Code</strong></td>
          <td colspan="3">: YESB0000513</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="terms">TERMS AND CONDITIONS</div>

      <div class="document">
        <ol class="terms-list">
          <li>
            Members of the society are governed by Govt. of Karnataka
            Co-operative Society by-Law Act 1960.
          </li>

          <li>
            Application for allotment of the Site in the Society is subject to
            the approval of the Membership/ Associate Membership, further
            clearance of land document by
            <span class="highlight">BDA/BMRDA/BIAPA/DTCP/RERA/DPA</span> and
            availability of the site.
          </li>

          <li>
            Members shall pay the initial payment as prescribed by the
            <span class="highlight"
              >"Defence Habitat Housing Co-operative Society Ltd"</span
            >, remaining installment also be paid in the prescribed time for
            development work.
          </li>

          <li>
            In case of members furnishing false information/declaration, the
            society reserves the right to call for document verification before
            allotment/cancellation.
          </li>

          <li>
            Members shall update the Mobile No, e-mail ID and address, from time
            to time to update the record in the office for all kinds of
            communication and reminders.
          </li>

          <li>
            Members willing to withdraw or transfer the membership/booking shall
            be accepted only after the completion of the project period.
            However, genuine reason, the Board members may decide which shall
            attract a penalty.
          </li>

          <li>
            Seniority for allotment of the site shall be made purely on the
            basis of initial payment and prompt receipt of regular installment
            payment. Becoming only a member of the society, will not confirm
            entitlement for allotment of the site.
          </li>

          <li>
            I agree to abide by the conditions of allotment and sale of site as
            described by the
            <span class="highlight"
              >"DEFENCE HABITAT HOUSING CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETY LTD"</span
            >, I, hereby declare that the above information furnished by me is
            true to the best of my knowledge. Furthermore, I shall furnish any
            other information that may be required with regards to allotment of
            site.
          </li>

          <li>
            I fully agree upon the above terms and conditions and it is binding
            on me.
          </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="declaration-section">
          <div class="declaration-title">DECLARATION</div>

          <div class="declaration-text">
            I wish to become a member and to purchase site of the
            <span class="highlight"
              >"DEFENCE HABITAT HOUSING CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETY LTD"</span
            >. I have read the above terms and conditions. Further, hereby I
            abide by all the terms & conditions mentioned in the bye-laws of the
            society Act 1960. And the decisions are taken by the Board from time
            to time, which shall be final and binding on me.
          </div>

          <div class="declaration-text">
            I declare that the particulars furnished by me are correct and true
            to the best my knowledge.
          </div>

          <div class="signature-section">
            <div class="signature-left">
              <div>Place: <span class="highlight">Bengaluru</span></div>
              <div>Date: <span class="highlight"><%= date %></span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="signature-right">
              <!-- <img src="<%= MemberSign %>" alt=""> -->
              <img width="130" height="130" src="<%= MemberSign %>" alt="" />
              <div class="signature-line"></div>
              <div>Signature of the Applicant</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="office-section">
          <div class="office-title">FOR THE USE OF OFFICE</div>

          <div class="office-fields">
            <div class="office-field">
              <span class="highlight">1. Date of receipt of application</span>
              <span class="field-line"></span>
              <span class="highlight">A.M. No.</span>
              <span class="field-line"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="office-field">
              <span class="highlight">2. Amount received Rs.</span>
              <span class="field-line"></span>
              <span class="highlight">Receipt No.</span>
              <span class="field-line"></span>
              <span class="highlight">Date.</span>
              <span class="field-line"></span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="office-signatures">
            <div class="signature-block">
              <div class="signature-line"></div>
              <div class="highlight">President</div>
            </div>
            <div class="signature-block">
              <div class="signature-line"></div>
              <div class="highlight">Secretary</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="board-section">
          <div class="board-title">DECISION OF THE BOARD</div>

          <div class="board-text">
            Accepted as member of this Housing Society in the board Meeting held
            on ________________ / Meeting book Page No ________________ for
            allotment or residential site in society's future / present Layout
            in accordance with the Byelaws, Subsidiary Rules, Policy decision
            taken by the Board/General Body from time to time and Rules, Acts
            and Policies of Government of Karnataka on the member.
          </div>

          <div class="office-field">Date: <span class="field-line"></span></div>

          <div class="board-signatures">
            <div class="signature-block">
              <div class="signature-line"></div>
              <div class="highlight">President</div>
            </div>
            <div class="signature-block">
              <div class="signature-line"></div>
              <div class="highlight">Secretary</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="page-number"></div>
      </div>
</body>
</html>
